## Original Content
हिसार में सफाई कर्मचारियों की करीब 20 दिनों से जारी हड़ताल के बीच नगर निगम प्रशासन ने भारी पुलिस बल की मौजूदगी में शहर से कचरा उठाने का अभियान चलाया।

## Summary
In Hisar, a clash occurred between sanitation workers and police during an ongoing 20-day strike. The municipal administration launched a garbage collection drive with heavy police presence to manage the situation.

## Key Points
- Sanitation workers in Hisar have been on strike for approximately 20 days.
- Municipal authorities initiated a garbage collection operation supported by heavy police presence.
- The confrontation led to a clash between the workers and police.
- The strike is disrupting city sanitation services.
- Police involvement suggests efforts to ensure essential services continue despite the strike.


